From: kkuo <kat.kuo@canonical.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Jan 2026 16:31:08 -0500
Subject: telemetry: Repurpose diagnostics panel for all telemetry
 applications

This patch renames and repurposes the diagnostics panel to be a catchall
for telemetry-related features.

The Diagnostics panel is renamed to Telemetry while maintaining the same
ABRT and Whoopsie functionality and modularization. To reduce the patch
size, the Diagnostics panel code is deactivated, not removed.

Additional modular integration with Ubuntu Insights via the insights
build argument is also added. This integration allows for user consent
to be managed in a centralized and fine-grained manner. Additionally,
functionality to generate and show an example report is also present.
